      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Outreach and follow-ups\nRuns every hour from 9:00 to 17:00, Monday to Friday (workflow timezone: Africa/Lagos; change it in workflow settings to match where your leads are).\n\n**TEST_MODE is on.** Every email goes to `TEST_INBOX` with `[TEST to real@address]` in the subject, and the sheet is updated as if it were real. Before going live, set `TEST_MODE` to false and reset the test rows (status back to `new`, clear the outreach columns).\n\nOther settings in **Config**: `OFFER`, `SENDER_NAME`, `MIN_SCORE`, `DAILY_SEND_CAP`, `MAX_PER_RUN`, `FOLLOWUP_DAYS`.",
          "height": 560,
          "width": 480,
          "color": 7
        },
        "id": "46f2ffc4-abab-45f8-aacd-c319ff58cd0c",
        "name": "Sticky Note 6a02c5d6",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          144,
          -64
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 1. Pick who to email\nFollow-ups that are due go first, then new leads with an email and `lead_score >= MIN_SCORE`, best score first.\n\nA run sends at most `MAX_PER_RUN` emails and stops for the day at `DAILY_SEND_CAP`, so sending is spread across the day. An address already in a sequence is never started again.",
          "height": 560,
          "width": 480,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "0a3bf8e7-bec1-465e-940d-038f1886f828",
        "name": "Sticky Note 83677ac3",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          672,
          -64
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 2. Write and send\nOpenAI GPT-5.4 writes each email for its step: 1 = intro using the personal opener, 2 = short bump with a new idea, 3 = polite break-up. The sign-off and the opt-out line are added by the workflow, not the AI, so they are always there.\n\nEmail 1 starts a new Gmail thread. Emails 2 and 3 are sent as replies to the last message, so the whole sequence stays in one thread.",
          "height": 780,
          "width": 1340,
          "color": 6
        },
        "id": "c5614b91-a500-4b31-bbb1-6f496e0c945c",
        "name": "Sticky Note 03725bb7",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          1184,
          -64
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 3. Record and pace\nSaves the Gmail thread and message IDs, counts the email, and sets the next follow-up date (`FOLLOWUP_DAYS` [3, 7] means day 3 and day 7 after the first email). After the last email the lead is marked `finished`.\n\nA random 30-90 second pause between sends keeps the pattern human.",
          "height": 560,
          "width": 480,
          "color": 5
        },
        "id": "e35544f1-1e76-43c1-bf76-20cc059e73c7",
        "name": "Sticky Note f57fb836",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          2592,
          -64
        ]
      },
